cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "伏羲框架：万物皆可学 (The Fuxi Framework: Everything Can Be Learned)"
authors:
  - name: "HuanMoovo"
date-released: "2026-10-03"
url: "https://github.com/HuanMoovo/fuxi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HuanMoovo/fuxi"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  A universal learning methodology organized as a 10-stage timeline
  (Orient, Map, Decompose, Encode, Retrieve, Space, Drill, Apply, Teach, Maintain)
  with evidence-graded methods (A/B/C/D), an open-source toolchain, learning
  templates, and a safe-AI usage protocol.
keywords:
  - learning science
  - spaced repetition
  - retrieval practice
  - deliberate practice
  - cognitive science
  - study methodology
  - open source
